fixture a_spell_ends_mend
doc docs/adr/0013, Mend: "a jump, dash, strike, spell or toss ... ends the channel and the Flame is lost" (task 6 review, M2): a spell pressed during Mend ends it and casts; it used to wait and drop.
room test/flat
option flame 66
option hearts 4
frames 70
input
  0..9 mend
  10 mend spell
  11..60 mend
end
expect
  at 9 spell=mend flame=33
  at 10 spell=kindle event.cast=1 flame=0
  never 0..69 event.fizzle=1
end
